  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "MAKEARRAY returns #VALUE! for non-positive dimensions, non-LAMBDA final arguments, or multi-cell LAMBDA results",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527.20088, MAKEARRAY(rows, cols, lambda) passes 1-based row and column numbers to a 2-parameter LAMBDA and rejects zero or negative dimensions, a non-LAMBDA third argument (even a number or error), wrong-arity LAMBDAs, and array results from the LAMBDA with #VALUE!.",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured in Excel 16.0.20527.20088 in f3_arrays (rows 40, 44) and jnt_aggregate_arrays (rows 108-110).",
